---
title: OMCS thin-kernel route selection
---
flowchart TD
    A[Profile and task evidence] --> B[Separate consequence, uncertainty, and blast radius]
    B --> C{Independent review required?}
    C -- no --> D{Concrete delegation value?}
    D -- no --> E[solo — default]
    D -- yes --> F[delegate — one auxiliary]
    C -- yes, auto or fast --> G[audit — one reviewer]
    C -- yes, thorough --> H{Delegation value?}
    H -- no --> G
    H -- yes --> I[full — implementer plus reviewer]
    E --> J[One final verification path]
    F --> J
    G --> J
    I --> J
    J --> K[Stop after green]
